ble with the latest version of tvOS.\r\n\r\nKey implementation goals:\r\n\r\n- Allow developers to export projects to tvOS, with proper input and rendering support.\r\n- Integrate tvOS export presets into the Godot Export UI, using a structure consistent with existing platforms (e.g., iOS).\r\n- Maintain engine cleanliness and stability by minimizing changes to existing code and reusing existing systems (input, rendering, etc.).\r\n\r\n📌 Highlights:\r\n\r\n- 🔧 New platform/tvos/ module to manage tvOS-specific exporting. \r\n- 🎮 Gamepad and Apple TV Remote support using Godot’s input system. \r\n- 🎨 Vulkan and Metal rendering compatibility via existing Godot renderer infrastructure. \r\n- 📤 Export Preset integration for tvOS in the editor. \r\n- 🛠️ SCons build target: platform=tvos. \r\n- ✅ Fully documented changes that follow Godot’s contribution and code formatting guidelines.\r\n\r\nPlease give it a shot and let me know if you run into issues.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-04-18T04:43:19Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T10:02:26Z","closed_at":"2025-04-18T06:47:26Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"d332fa7918a322d38baff64ab589cd63785987da","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"jhaleit:master","ref":"master","repo":null,"sha":"b8edfc58047f21cc54d6e4fd868afeb9a42d1d1a","user":{"login":"jhaleit